Package: keenetic-entware-extras
Version: 0.3.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ald
Description: Shared shell libraries for keenetic-entware-extras packages.
 Provides common.sh (logging, validation), lists.sh (list processing with
 @include support, deduplication), and ip.sh (CIDR aggregation, ISP interface
 detection, DNS resolver auto-detection).
 Base package for geo-split and others.
Section: lib
Priority: optional
